  "details": "The pcs packages provide a command-line configuration system for the Pacemaker and Corosync utilities.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * python-tornado: Tornado: Denial of Service via excessive URL-encoded body fields (CVE-2026-82397)\n  * python-tornado: Tornado before 6.4.1 HTTP Request Smuggling via Transfer-Encoding (CVE-2024-14029)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
